    "UIName": "UrbanMech 'Wedding Ball'",
    "Id": "mechdef_urbanmech_UM-WB",
    "Name": "UrbanMech UM-WB",
    "Details": "Originally entered as the Wrecking Ball before just rolling with an autocorrect error and made famous by Cyrus Miles in the arenas, this 'Mech was a last ditch attempt from Montana Customs after the team owner's wife, Hannah, was awarded the team stable, house, kids, and the cybernetic half of the dog in the divorce. With almost nothing left, the team found a junkyard Urbanmech and welded on anything that wasn't bolted down. This underdog ended up winning the season, beating out the ex-wife's stable and saving Montana Customs from bankruptcy.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_urbanmech"
  },
